例如，向支持这些 Skills 的代理输入：

```
Use problem-framing-canvas to analyze my project.

First identify the actual problem, affected users, evidence,
constraints, and assumptions. Do not jump to a solution.
Ask only essential clarifying questions.
```

随后再调用 `prioritization-advisor`，而不是一开始就要求 AI 输出一整套 PRD。

## 2. SVPG：Product Model Concepts

[阅读原文](https://www.svpg.com/product-model-concepts/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

SVPG 的核心价值不是提供模板，而是约束产品经理的思考方式：先确定要取得什么结果，再决定做什么功能。

它强调的关键概念包括产品战略、赋能型产品团队、产品发现和产品交付。产品发现需要同时考虑客户价值、可用性、技术可行性和商业可行性；产品交付之后还要验证实际结果。

[image](https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://www.svpg.com\&sz=32)

Silicon Valley Product Group



建议把这些原则写进你自己的总控规则，而不是每次都把整篇文章贴给 AI。

例如：

```
Apply the SVPG product model principles.

Before recommending a feature:
1. State the desired outcome.
2. Identify the customer problem and supporting evidence.
3. Evaluate value, usability, feasibility, and viability.
4. Separate assumptions from verified facts.
5. Recommend experiments when important risks remain.
6. Define how post-release outcomes will be measured.

Do not equate shipping a feature with achieving success.
```

这段是基于 SVPG 思想整理的自定义规则，不是 SVPG 官方发布的 Skill。

## 3. SVPG：Articles 文章库

[打开文章目录](https://www.svpg.com/articles/?utm_source=chatgpt.com)

这里应该采用按问题检索、阅读、提炼原则的方式，不建议把所有文章一次性塞进上下文。

建议重点关注这些主题：

| 主题                      | 什么时候看             |
| ----------------------- | ----------------- |
| Product Management      | 产品经理的职责、需求决策      |
| Product Discovery       | 判断用户问题、验证解决方案     |
| Product Strategy        | 定位、竞争优势、战略取舍      |
| Product Teams           | 产品、设计、工程团队如何协作    |
| Product Operating Model | 如何建立持续发现、交付和衡量的流程 |

SVPG 的文章目录支持按主题、作者等维度浏览。

[image](https://www.google.com/s2/favicons?domain=https://www.svpg.com\&sz=32)

Silicon Valley Product Group



可以直接让 AI 执行：

```
When a product decision requires deeper theoretical grounding:

1. Search SVPG articles for the relevant topic.
2. Read the original articles, not just search snippets.
3. Extract the core principle, its assumptions, and limitations.
4. Translate the principle into a concrete decision rule.
5. Cite the original article and distinguish its claims
   from your own recommendations.

Do not treat every SVPG recommendation as universally applicable.
```

建议产出： 把经过验证的原则整理成 `product-principles.md`，供后续产品决策复用。

